color":"#4e2f1a"},{"type":"rect","x":5,"y":13,"w":10,"h":1.5,"color":"#4e2f1a"},{"type":"rect","x":4,"y":22,"w":24,"h":10,"color":"#4e2f1a"},{"type":"rect","x":2,"y":24,"w":2,"h":6,"color":"#4e2f1a"},{"type":"rect","x":5,"y":23,"w":22,"h":8,"color":"#b8844a"},{"type":"rect","x":9,"y":26,"w":12,"h":1.5,"color":"#4e2f1a"},{"type":"rect","x":10,"y":44,"w":12,"h":4,"color":"#5fa84a"}],"layer":"back"}],"rooms":[{"id":"mount-paozu","name":"Mount Paozu","objective":"Head down the mountain to the forest","layout":["........................................................................","........................................................................","........................................................................","........................................................................","..................................................2.....................","........................................................................",".....................................................=====..............","........................................................................","........................................................................","......................======......###..........======...................",".............##...................###...................................","..S.....a##..##...............1...###...C..4^^..................1....E..","#################...######################################...###########","#################...######################################...###########"],"isBossRoom":false,"exit":{"toRoom":"the-forest"},"props":[{"prop":"dome-house","col":3,"row":11},{"prop":"four-star-ball","col":7,"row":11},{"prop":"pine-tree","col":11,"row":11},{"prop":"pine-tree","col":15,"row":11},{"prop":"boulder","col":20,"row":11},{"prop":"tall-grass","col":32,"row":11},{"prop":"rock-spire","col":37,"row":11},{"prop":"signpost","col":41,"row":11},{"prop":"bush","col":61,"row":11},{"prop":"pine-tree","col":66,"row":11}]},{"id":"the-forest","name":"The Forest","objective":"Track the thief through the forest","layout":["............................................................................","............................................................................","............................................................................",".........................................................2..................","............................................................................","............................................................................",".......................................................=====................","............................................................................","..........................======............................................","........=====...................................======........##............","......................##......................................##............","..S..b........1.......##....4....3..^^..C................^^...##....3....E..","#################...#######################...##############################","#################...#######################...##############################"],"isBossRoom":false,"exit":{"toRoom":"bear-thiefs-clearing"},"props":[{"prop":"pine-tree","col":0,"row":11},{"prop":"boulder","col":9,"row":11},{"prop":"pine-tree","col":15,"row":11},{"prop":"pine-tree","col":24,"row":11},{"prop":"boulder","col":38,"row":11},{"prop":"bush","col":46,"row":11},{"prop":"rock-spire","col":62,"row":8},{"prop":"pine-tree","col":65,"row":11},{"prop":"tall-grass","col":70,"row":11},{"prop":"signpost","col":71,"row":11}]},{"id":"bear-thiefs-clearing","name":"Bear Thief's Clearing","objective":"Defeat the Bear Thief","layout":["..............................................","..............................................","..............................................","..............................................","..............................................","..............................................","................=====.........................","...............................====...........","..............................................",".........=====..........=====.................","..............................................","..S..................^^.................B.....","##############################################","##############################################"],"isBossRoom":true,"exit":{"toRoom":"END"},"props":[{"prop":"pine-tree","col":0,"row":11},{"prop":"boulder","col":5,"row":11},{"prop":"pine-tree","col":14,"row":11},{"prop":"boulder","col":25,"row":11},{"prop":"rock-spire","col":29,"row":11},{"prop":"bush","col":35,"row":11},{"prop":"pine-tree","col":44,"row":11}]}],"dialogue":{"roomIntro":[[{"speaker":"Goku","text":"Grandpa's Dragon Ball is safe and sound. Time to go catch some dinner!"},{"speaker":"Goku","text":"Wolves up here are hungry too. Stay sharp."}],[{"speaker":"Goku","text":"Somebody big came through here. Those footprints have claws!"},{"speaker":"Goku","text":"Ooh, a sabre-tooth. This could be a good warm-up."}],[{"speaker":"Goku","text":"Found you! Give back what you stole, mister bear."}]],"bossIntro":[{"speaker":"Bear Thief","text":"This is my forest, kid. Turn around or I'll make you my lunch!"},{"speaker":"Goku","text":"Wow, you're huge! Bet you're strong. Let's fight!"}],"bossDefeated":[{"speaker":"Bear Thief","text":"Ugh... the brat hits like a mountain falling on me..."},{"speaker":"Goku","text":"That was fun! Now, anyone know where I can find dinner?"}],"playerDefeated":[{"speaker":"Bear Thief","text":"Hah! Back to the mountains with you, little one."},{"speaker":"Goku","text":"Okay, okay... I just need to train a bit more!"}]}},"notes":{"sourceFacts":["Dragon Ball episode 1 is 'The Secret of the Dragon Balls'; Goku lives alone on Mount Paozu.","Goku keeps his late grandfather Gohan's four-star Dragon Ball.","Goku is known for the Kamehameha, the Flying Nimbus cloud and the Power Pole (Nyoibo).","Pterodactyls and other giant prehistoric animals appear in Goku's wilderness in the early episodes.","Bulma meets Goku in episode 1 while hunting the seven Dragon Balls with her Dragon Radar.","Umigame is a sea turtle Goku and Bulma help return to the sea, which leads them to Master Roshi.","Oolong is a shape-shifting pig the pair meet early in their journey."],"designChoices":["The playable Goku is the iconic adult version, not the child Goku of episode 1.","Rigs are simplified fan-style pixel versions of the cast in their iconic colours (Goku's orange gi with blue belt, Bulma's teal hair and pink dress, Oolong in green).","The Bear Thief (a sword-wielding bear bandit) appears in the early episodes; making him the boss of this episode-1 world is a design choice. His sword is held off to the side so it never covers his face.","Room order Mount Paozu -> The Forest -> Bear Thief's Clearing is invented for the game.","Wolves, a pterodactyl and a sabre-tooth tiger are the regular enemies, placed at animal/ordinary-adult tier on the reference scale.","Oolong is a regular walker enemy at ordinary-adult tier (HP 40, AD 6); a trickster cap and smoke puff stand in for his shape-shifting.","Bulma (room 1) and Umigame (room 2) are friendly NPCs; meeting Umigame in the forest is a design choice (in the show he is stranded near a beach).","Scenery props: Grandpa Gohan's dome house and the four-star Dragon Ball on Mount Paozu, pine trees, boulders, rock spires, bushes, tall grass and signposts.","Kamehameha and Ki Blast deal magic (ki) damage with the ENERGY tag; punches deal physical damage.","Every room is laid out so even a toddler-tier character can walk and jump to the exit without abilities."]},"createdAt":"2026-11-21T12:00:00.000Z"}$$), '2026-11-21T12:00:00.000Z'::TIMESTAMP_TZ;

